2. Example images (ontologies/fashion/examples/images/*.jpg)
   Synthetic lookbook photos of the fictional brand AnyCompany Fashion House, generated with Amazon Nova Canvas
   on Amazon Bedrock (model ID amazon.nova-canvas-v1:0; the original file name per file in
   manifest.json). They depict no real person and contain no third-party photography. MIT-0.

   Single-piece product photos (ontologies/fashion/examples/items/*.jpg)
   Synthetic product shots of the fictional brand AnyCompany Fashion House's catalog, generated with Amazon Nova
   Canvas on Amazon Bedrock (model ID amazon.nova-canvas-v1:0; the product shot per file in
   manifest.json). They depict no real person, carry no logo or lettering and contain no
   third-party photography. MIT-0.

3. Synthetic data set (ontologies/fashion/datasets/anycompany-apparel/)
   Authored for this repository; fictional brand, products, looks and editorial copy. MIT-0.

4. AnyCompany Fashion House data set (ontologies/fashion/datasets/anycompany-fashion-house/)
   One look of a fictional brand, synthetic. The photo (media/looks/) is one more photo of the
   AnyCompany Fashion House lookbook, generated with Amazon Nova Canvas on Amazon Bedrock; it shows no real
   person, and the pieces were read from it by the sample's own classify step. MIT-0.

